---
title: "Krewire Community — Get Started, Contribute & Support"
description: "The community front door for the Krewire open-source ecosystem: a canonical path to your first project, contributor guidance, and transparent support information."
layout: Landing
---

<div class="contributors-portal">

  <!-- HERO SECTION -->
  <section class="hero" id="overview">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow" data-i18n="hero.eyebrow">◈ OPEN-SOURCE COLLECTIVE · BORN IN INDONESIA · FOR THE WORLD</div>
        <h1 data-i18n-html="hero.title_html">Build with Krewire. Contribute Code.<br>Empower Indonesian Engineers.</h1>
        <p class="lead" data-i18n="hero.lead">Krewire is an open-source movement engineered in Indonesia to turn builders from software consumers into world-class creators. With our open-core modular Go libraries, active contributors earn lifetime commercial product licenses, while community support helps sustain long-term maintenance.</p>
        <div class="ctas flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <Button Variant="primary" Size="lg" Href="#start" DataI18n="hero.cta_start">Get Started →</Button>
          <Button Variant="secondary" Size="lg" Href="#pathways" DataI18n="hero.cta_contribute">Start Contributing</Button>
          <Button Variant="outline" Size="lg" Href="#sponsorship" DataI18n="hero.cta_sponsor">Support Krewire</Button>
        </div>
        <div class="meta" data-i18n="hero.meta">100% Open Source Core (MIT) · Community-Owned · Independent Infrastructure · AI-Assisted Synergy</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-art">
        <div class="code-terminal-card">
          <div class="code-terminal-bar">
            <div class="terminal-dots">
              <span class="term-dot red"></span>
              <span class="term-dot yellow"></span>
              <span class="term-dot green"></span>
            </div>
            <span class="term-title">kiw — your first project</span>
          </div>
          <div class="code-terminal-body">
            <div class="term-line term-muted"># install kiw first: krewire.com/docs/getting-started/installation</div>
            <div class="term-line"><span class="term-prompt">$</span> <span class="term-cmd">kiw new my-site --site</span></div>
            <div class="term-line term-success">✓ scaffolded Krewire project (variant=static)</div>
            <div class="term-line"><span class="term-prompt">$</span> <span class="term-cmd">cd my-site &amp;&amp; kiw dev</span></div>
            <div class="term-line term-muted mt-2"># full quickstart: krewire.com/docs/getting-started</div>
            <div class="term-line term-info">⚡ 100% Open Source Core (MIT) · Crafted in Indonesia</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

